{%- comment -%}
  Rating and stock row block for main-product.
  Accepts: block, product, current_variant
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- comment -%}
  R232.30 — Separator "|" between rating + stock indicator
  was previously gated only on the merchant's
  show_rating + show_stock toggles, NOT on whether the
  rating actually has data. On products with no review
  metafield (default Shopify products) the rating
  snippet returned an empty string but the "|" still
  painted, leaving the stock row reading "| In Stock"
  with a dangling pipe on the left. Capture the
  rating output first and only emit the separator
  when the capture has real content. */
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign meta_has_rating = false -%}
{%- if block.settings.show_rating -%}
  {%- capture meta_rating_html -%}
    {%- render 'product-rating', product: product -%}
  {%- endcapture -%}
  {%- assign meta_rating_html = meta_rating_html | strip -%}
  {%- if meta_rating_html != blank -%}
    {%- assign meta_has_rating = true -%}
  {%- endif -%}
{%- endif -%}
<div class="kt-pdp__meta" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
  {%- if meta_has_rating -%}
    {{ meta_rating_html }}
  {%- endif -%}
  {%- comment -%}
    Gift cards never display stock pills — they're
    inventory-less by definition. Theme Store reviewers
    flag "Sold out" or "In Stock" status on gift card
    PDPs as broken merchandising; the gate hides every
    stock-status surface for gift cards even when the
    merchant has the show_stock block setting on.
  {%- endcomment -%}
  {%- assign show_stock_block = block.settings.show_stock -%}
  {%- if product.gift_card? -%}
    {%- assign show_stock_block = false -%}
  {%- endif -%}
  {%- if meta_has_rating and show_stock_block -%}
    <span class="kt-pdp__meta-sep" aria-hidden="true">|</span>
  {%- endif -%}
  {%- if show_stock_block -%}
    {%- comment -%}
      R122 — three-state stock indicator with low-stock
      "Only N left" messaging when:
      1. Variant has Shopify-managed inventory
      2. Has stock left (>0)
      3. Stock count is at-or-below the merchant-set
         threshold (settings.kt_low_stock_threshold)
      4. Merchant has the kt_show_low_stock toggle on
      Real inventory (not deceptive/fake counter) —
      Theme Store rule allows this when backed by
      Shopify's actual inventory_quantity.
    {%- endcomment -%}
    {%- assign show_low_stock = false -%}
    {%- if settings.kt_show_low_stock and current_variant.available and current_variant.inventory_management == 'shopify' and current_variant.inventory_quantity > 0 and current_variant.inventory_quantity <= settings.kt_low_stock_threshold -%}
      {%- assign show_low_stock = true -%}
    {%- endif -%}
    {%- comment -%}
      R298 — The low-stock span ALWAYS ships in the DOM
      (hidden when not applicable) so `product-form.js`'s
      variant-change handler can toggle visibility +
      text atomically when the merchant selects a
      different variant. Before this, the element only
      rendered when conditions were true on initial
      paint, so a variant flip from "20 in stock" to
      "3 left" never surfaced the badge.
    {%- endcomment -%}
    <span class="kt-pdp__stock kt-pdp__stock--low" role="status" data-low-stock {% unless show_low_stock %}hidden{% endunless %}>
      {%- if show_low_stock -%}
        {{ 'kt.product.low_stock_html' | t: count: current_variant.inventory_quantity | default: 'Only a few left' }}
      {%- endif -%}
    </span>
    {%- comment -%}
      R298 — In-stock / sold-out spans always ship in the
      DOM with `hidden` toggled. Without the always-render
      pattern, `product-form.js`'s variant-change handler
      cannot atomically swap In Stock ↔ Sold out when the
      customer flips between available and unavailable
      variants — Theme Store "atomic variant update"
      requirement (same fix class as the low-stock badge
      above and the pre-order badge in product-form.liquid).
      `data-stock-status` lets JS pick the right span and
      a sibling `data-low-stock` element keeps owning the
      low-stock state independently.
    {%- endcomment -%}
    {%- assign initial_show_in = false -%}
    {%- assign initial_show_out = false -%}
    {%- unless show_low_stock -%}
      {%- if current_variant.available -%}
        {%- assign initial_show_in = true -%}
      {%- else -%}
        {%- assign initial_show_out = true -%}
      {%- endif -%}
    {%- endunless -%}
    <span class="kt-pdp__stock kt-pdp__stock--in" data-stock-status="in"{% unless initial_show_in %} hidden{% endunless %}>{{ 'kt.product.in_stock' | t | default: 'In Stock' }}</span>
    <span class="kt-pdp__stock kt-pdp__stock--out" data-stock-status="out"{% unless initial_show_out %} hidden{% endunless %}>{{ 'kt.product.sold_out' | t }}</span>
  {%- endif -%}
</div>
